  "implementation_outline": [
    "The runner records exact selected method/version, request parameters, source-slot refs, schemas, and scalar/empty input fingerprints when capture_dispatch_binding is explicitly requested; the option is separate from scientific method_params. The older caller-supplied capture_execution_work path remains compatible and is not inserted by the runner.",
    "The evaluator persists producer-selected profile refs and reloads the actual result/evidence through a fresh CAS; it recomputes content and dispatch consistency but does not claim this proves who executed the method.",
    "The registry preserves measured metrics as candidate evidence and requires a trusted execution-provenance basis for protected promotion; absent that basis, promotable is false and the surfaced PromotionDecision is REJECT.",
    "ClaimGold/ClaimAdjudication remains a separate consumer path. This slice does not change scientific qualification, issuer appointment, currentness, or public authority semantics."
  ],
